Interactive Visual Analytics
============================
Interactive visual analytics 
> enables users to explore and manipulate data in an interactive and real-time way
> users can find visual patterns faster and more effectively
> interactive data visualisation or dashboarding can tell a more appealing story

Common interactions include:
> zoom-in and zoom-out 
> pan
> filter
> search
> link

***Folium and Ploty Dash will be used to build interactive map and dashboard***

> Folium to analyse launch site geo and proximities 
  - mark launch sites and their close proximities on an interactive map
  - explore the map with those markers and try to discover patterns
  - explain how to choose an optimal launch site

> Plotly Dash to build a dashboard application
  - includes input components including dropdown list and a range slider to interact with a pie chart and a scatter point chart
